1
00:00:03,169 --> 00:00:04,324
Hey.

2
00:00:04,949 --> 00:00:05,666
What's the business

3
00:00:05,667 --> 00:00:06,667
department doing here?

4
00:00:06,868 --> 00:00:07,918
We're here for

5
00:00:07,919 --> 00:00:09,204
the English debate club retreat.

6
00:00:10,747 --> 00:00:11,747
What a coincidence.

7
00:00:12,457 --> 00:00:13,861
Then how about we have

8
00:00:13,862 --> 00:00:15,877
a drink together tonight?

9
00:00:19,381 --> 00:00:20,156
And just in time

10
00:00:20,157 --> 00:00:21,157
our president's here.

11
00:00:21,966 --> 00:00:23,126
What do you think, President?

12
00:00:23,385 --> 00:00:24,385
You heard that, right?

13
00:00:29,557 --> 00:00:30,557
Do as you like.

14
00:00:49,869 --> 00:00:51,579
Have you been well?

15
00:00:56,668 --> 00:00:58,962
It's nothing, really.

16
00:00:59,421 --> 00:01:00,101
I just had a minor twist

17
00:01:00,102 --> 00:01:01,089
during basketball practice.

18
00:01:01,089 --> 00:01:02,089
Just?

19
00:01:05,176 --> 00:01:06,136
Well...

20
00:01:06,136 --> 00:01:07,136
Han Se-woon.

21
00:01:10,807 --> 00:01:11,808
What am I to you?

22
00:01:15,019 --> 00:01:16,187
I told you clearly.

23
00:01:17,522 --> 00:01:18,506
I hate seeing my people

24
00:01:18,507 --> 00:01:19,627
get hurt more than anything.

25
00:01:21,151 --> 00:01:22,174
But do you know

26
00:01:22,175 --> 00:01:23,236
what's even worse?

27
00:01:27,574 --> 00:01:28,575
More than anyone else

28
00:01:29,492 --> 00:01:30,827
I was the last to know.
